  </span>
  <span class="lc-thumb">
    <img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202301/midjourney-pro-tips/images/midjourney-pro-tips-card-01_hu_31b2732656cc6583.webp" width="320" height="320" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
  </span>
</a>

